33
00:04:20,704 --> 00:04:27,536
compute constants in registers instead of loading from memory. The dq dot checkAllRdCosts function at three hundred fifteen

34
00:04:27,536 --> 00:04:34,367
lines was the first Phase Two dispatch entry, targeting the encoder's hottest function at twenty-one point seven percent

35
00:04:34,367 --> 00:04:41,199
